<%- include('./partials/navbar') %>

<section class="policy-page-section" style="padding: 40px 16px 80px; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-main, #1a1a1a);">
  <div class="policy-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #2c7a4b; background: #e8f5ed; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Support & FAQs</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #1f5735;">Help Center</h1>
    <p style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 16px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">Everything you need to know about shopping, delivery, payments, and account support at Shanmukha Stores.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="help-cards-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
      <div style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;">📦</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1f5735;">Orders & Tracking</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6c757d; margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.6;">Track live status from your Orders page or get instant updates directly on WhatsApp.</p>
      <a href="/orders" style="color: #2c7a4b; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">View My Orders →</a>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
      <div style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;">💳</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1f5735;">Payments & UPI</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6c757d; margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.6;">We support Instant UPI QR scan, Cash on Delivery (COD), and direct WhatsApp order confirmation.</p>
      <a href="/shipping-policy" style="color: #2c7a4b; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Payment FAQs →</a>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);">
      <div style="font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 12px;">🚚</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #1f5735;">Shipping & Returns</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6c757d; margin: 0 0 14px; line-height: 1.6;">Fast local delivery across Vijayawada, standard courier across Andhra Pradesh and India.</p>
      <a href="/return-policy" style="color: #2c7a4b; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;">Return Policy →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-container" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 16px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 24px; color: #1f5735; border-bottom: 2px solid #e8f5ed; padding-bottom: 12px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f5;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #212529;">1. How do I place an order?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #495057; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Browse our products, select your desired weight variant or pack size, and click <strong>Add to Cart</strong>. Proceed to checkout, choose your saved address, select your payment method (UPI QR, COD, or WhatsApp), and click place order.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f5;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #212529;">2. What are the delivery charges and minimum order values?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #495057; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">For local orders in <strong>Vijayawada</strong>, the minimum order value is ₹499 with express same-day/next-day dispatch. For all locations <strong>other than Vijayawada</strong>, the minimum order value is ₹899. Detailed rates are outlined in our <a href="/shipping-policy" style="color: #2c7a4b; text-decoration: underline;">Shipping Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f5;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #212529;">3. How does the WhatsApp order feature work?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #495057; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">During checkout, selecting the <strong>WhatsApp Order</strong> option automatically formats your entire shopping cart, items, address, and total into a pre-filled WhatsApp message sent directly to our store manager for personalized confirmation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item" style="margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f3f5;">
      <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 8px; color: #212529;">4. How can I contact customer support?</h4>
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #495057; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">You can reach our team via phone or WhatsApp at <strong>+91 88863 83838</strong>, or email us at <strong>shanmukhastores@yahoo.com</strong> (Monday to Saturday, 9:00 AM – 7:00 PM).</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('./partials/footer') %>
